{"id":"A2-L020","title":"Past Simple questions: practice and contrast","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U02","focus":"Past Simple — questions — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Past Simple — questions — prática e contraste","pron":"Ligação entre palavras","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["crowded","comments","markdown","giveaway","rush","waiting line","kiosk","socks","register","impulse","doorbuster","early bird","hot deal","limited offer","flash sale","promo code"],"field":"Compras","genre":"Blog, diário, crônica","skill":"Escuta","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 20 · Past Simple questions: practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Past Simple — questions — prática e contraste.","**Pronúncia:** Ligação entre palavras.","**16 palavras novas** (compras).","**Texto do dia:** blog, diário, crônica."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo contrastar did, was/were e do/does em um blog."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["crowded","lotado"],["comments","comentários"],["markdown","remarcação"],["giveaway","barbada"],["rush","correria"],["waiting line","fila de espera"],["kiosk","quiosque"],["socks","meias"],["register","caixa registradora"],["impulse","impulso"],["doorbuster","doorbuster"],["early bird","early bird"],["hot deal","hot deal"],["limited offer","limited offer"],["flash sale","flash sale"],["promo code","promo code"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A blog post","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Did You Enjoy Black Friday?","paras":["Last Friday I **went** shopping at six. **Was** it crowded? Very! **Did** I buy anything? Only socks. **Why** did I stay? Because the line **was** fun.","**Did you** go? **What did you** buy? **Were** the prices low? Tell me in the comments."],"kicker":"SHOPPING BLOG","by":"Zoe","gloss":[["crowded","lotado"],["comments","comentários"],["line","fila"],["socks","meias"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Zoe went shopping at six.","ans":"T","why":"“at six.”"},{"q":"The store was empty.","ans":"F","why":"crowded."},{"q":"Zoe bought socks.","ans":"T","why":"“Only socks.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“crowded” means…","opts":["lotado","vazio","caro"],"ans":0,"why":"crowded."},{"q":"“comments” means…","opts":["comentários","compras","cores"],"ans":0,"why":"comments."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Past questions: did / was / were","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Pergunta","Resposta"],"rows":[["be","**Was it crowded?**","**Yes, it was.**"],["be (plural)","**Were the prices low?**","**No, they weren’t.**"],["outros","**Did you buy it?**","**No, I didn’t.**"]],"cap":"Past questions: did / was / were"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Com **be** não use **did**: *Was it crowded?* (não *Did it was crowded?*)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ it crowded? (be)","a":"Was","why":"be."},{"s":"___ the prices low? (be)","a":"Were","why":"be plural."},{"s":"___ you buy anything? (do)","a":"Did","why":"did."},{"s":"Why ___ you stay? (did)","a":"did","why":"did."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["crowded","lotado"],["comments","comentários"],["markdown","remarcação"],["giveaway","barbada"],["rush","correria"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["at","the","mall","Were","you"],"ans":"Were you at the mall","pt":"Você esteve no shopping?"},{"words":["buy","anything","Did","you"],"ans":"Did you buy anything","pt":"Comprou algo?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"crowded","pos":"word","pt":"lotado","ex":"A crowded mall.","expt":"Um shopping lotado."},{"w":"comments","pos":"word","pt":"comentários","ex":"Read the comments.","expt":"Leia os comentários."},{"w":"markdown","pos":"word","pt":"remarcação","ex":"A big markdown.","expt":"Uma grande remarcação."},{"w":"giveaway","pos":"word","pt":"barbada","ex":"It is a giveaway!","expt":"É uma barbada!"},{"w":"rush","pos":"word","pt":"correria","ex":"The Friday rush.","expt":"A correria de sexta."},{"w":"waiting line","pos":"word","pt":"fila de espera","ex":"A waiting line.","expt":"Uma fila de espera."},{"w":"kiosk","pos":"word","pt":"quiosque","ex":"A small kiosk.","expt":"Um quiosque pequeno."},{"w":"socks","pos":"word","pt":"meias","ex":"Warm socks.","expt":"Meias quentes."},{"w":"register","pos":"word","pt":"caixa registradora","ex":"Go to the register.","expt":"Vá ao caixa."},{"w":"impulse","pos":"word","pt":"impulso","ex":"An impulse buy.","expt":"Uma compra por impulso."},{"w":"doorbuster","pos":"word","pt":"doorbuster","ex":"oferta-isca","expt":"A doorbuster deal."},{"w":"early bird","pos":"word","pt":"early bird","ex":"madrugador","expt":"An early bird offer."},{"w":"hot deal","pos":"word","pt":"hot deal","ex":"oferta quente","expt":"A hot deal."},{"w":"limited offer","pos":"word","pt":"limited offer","ex":"oferta limitada","expt":"A limited offer."},{"w":"flash sale","pos":"word","pt":"flash sale","ex":"promoção relâmpago","expt":"A flash sale."},{"w":"promo code","pos":"word","pt":"promo code","ex":"código promocional","expt":"Enter the promo code."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Were you at the mall?** — Você esteve no shopping?","**Yes, I was. It was crowded.** — Sim. Estava lotado.","**Did you buy anything?** — Comprou algo?","**Nice job!** — Bom trabalho!","**Well done!** — Muito bem!","**Good point.** — Bom argumento.","**Fair enough.** — Justo."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"cut","pt":"cortar","forms":[["I / you / we / they cut","I cut bread."],["he / she / it cuts","She cuts the paper."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"After Black Friday","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"After Black Friday","lines":[["Zoe","Were you at the mall?","Você esteve no shopping?"],["Jay","Yes, I was. It was crowded.","Sim. Estava lotado."],["Zoe","Did you buy anything?","Comprou algo?"],["Jay","No, I didn’t. The queue was long.","Não. A fila estava longa."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Ligação entre palavras","items":[{"label":"Ligação entre palavras","note":"Consoante final liga à vogal seguinte: pick it up → pi-ki-tup.","words":["pick it up","turn it off","an apple","check in"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Ask two past questions with was/were.","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Was it crowded? Were the prices low?"},{"q":"Ask with did.","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Did you buy anything?"},{"q":"Answer in short form.","pt":"Responda.","model":"Yes, it was. / No, I didn’t."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 questions about a shopping day.","model":"Was the mall crowded? Were the prices low? Did you buy anything? What did you buy? Why did you stay?","checklist":["Usei **was/were**","Usei **did**","Usei **5 perguntas**"],"words":"5 perguntas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “crowded” mean?","opts":["lotado","comentários","barbada"],"ans":0,"why":"**crowded** = lotado."},{"q":"What does “comments” mean?","opts":["remarcação","comentários","correria"],"ans":1,"why":"**comments** = comentários."},{"q":"What does “markdown” mean?","opts":["barbada","fila de espera","remarcação"],"ans":2,"why":"**markdown** = remarcação."},{"q":"What does “giveaway” mean?","opts":["barbada","correria","quiosque"],"ans":0,"why":"**giveaway** = barbada."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}